WEBVTT

00:12.840 --> 00:14.000
Your Highness...

00:17.960 --> 00:21.500
My retainers will escort you along the way; no one will dare mistreat you.

00:21.880 --> 00:30.500
Master Yu, let past grievances pass by your ears without weighing down your heart. So long as a man lives, hope endures.

00:31.280 --> 00:36.000
It is this unworthy subject... who brought calamity and disgrace upon Your Highness!

00:41.360 --> 00:45.500
May Master Yu take care of himself.

00:51.400 --> 00:53.000
Take care, Your Highness!

01:32.480 --> 01:34.000
What are you all doing?

01:40.240 --> 01:44.800
We humble scholars offer our deepest reverence and thanks for Your Highness's benevolent grace!

01:45.000 --> 01:49.200
We thank Your Highness for shielding our master's life!

01:51.800 --> 01:56.500
Should the heavens grant us opportunity hereafter, we shall repay Your Highness's immense kindness with our lives!

01:57.160 --> 02:02.000
Enough. You are all the pillars and future bulwark of Great Xuan.

02:03.120 --> 02:06.500
Rise, all of you—please rise!

02:09.360 --> 02:16.500
I hope everyone takes this ordeal as a solemn warning... as shall I.

02:17.240 --> 02:21.200
We humble students shall forever engrave Your Highness's teachings upon our hearts!
